OL,4,CTech stock sell-off drags markets down 
OL,5,Cas Anthropic shares slide              
OL,6,GAnthropic's shares have dropped back   
OL,7,Gtowards their initial price after a    
OL,8,Gsoaring first day on the stock market, 
OL,9,Gas a wider tech sell-off dragged       
OL,10,Gmarkets down.                          
OL,12,FThe sell-off comes as concerns remain  
OL,13,Fover the speed and size of artificial  
OL,14,Fintelligence investment, but also as   
OL,15,Fsome large companies including Nvidia  
OL,16,Fand SpaceX faced specific issues that  
OL,17,Fworried investors.                     
OL,22,                                   G3/9 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
