OL,4,CTrump threatens ban on US firms        
OL,5,Cbuilding AI data centres overseas      
OL,6,GDonald Trump has said he will ban US   
OL,7,Gcompanies from building AI data        
OL,8,Gcentres overseas, threatening a        
OL,9,G"tremendous tax" for tech firms who do 
OL,10,Gso.                                    
OL,12,F"We're going to keep it all in this    
OL,13,Fcountry," the US president said, while 
OL,14,Fproviding little detail on the         
OL,15,Fpotential policy he said others in his 
OL,16,Fcabinet were hearing about for the     
OL,17,Ffirst time.                            
OL,22,                                   G4/9 
